  "nameEn": "Spiral of Functions",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Function \"Spiral side\" walks to an obstacle and deals with lamps and items. Function \"Turn\" calls it twice, turning right after each side. Call \"Turn\" 4 times.",
  "descriptionEn": "The summary of the whole topic: a big spiral of 31 steps. A side is a function, a turn of two sides is a function that calls a function, and the whole spiral is four turns.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Function \"Spiral side\" walks to an obstacle and deals with lamps and items (turn off shining ones, only repair sparking ones). Function \"Turn\" calls it twice, turning right after each side. Call \"Turn\" 4 times."
